preConditionHook:
// EL: ticks >= minVolume, lowercase as the feature register writes it.
//
// `ticks`, NOT the `volume` alias: EL's `volume` is UP-TICKS only
// (EL_Volume_Probe.txt, @KW 480min and 1440min, 18,203/18,203 bars), so an
// ABSOLUTE liquidity floor -- a share or contract count -- must read `ticks`
// (up + down). VolumeAboveAverageMultiple makes the same substitution;
// VolumeBelowAverage and VolumeBelowAverageFraction deliberately do not,
// because a ratio of up-ticks to its own average is still a meaningful
// measure while an absolute up-tick floor is not.
//
// No window and no state, so nothing to precompute.
